<title>UK: HTV yr op profit rises 0.8 pct.</title>
<headline>HTV yr op profit rises 0.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.5		   vs 10.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.75		   vs *</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 4.15		   vs 3.75</p>
<p> Operating profit	 12.6		   vs 12.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   139.3		  vs 135</p>
<p> Profit on ord activities 9.9		  vs 12.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British regional television company is HTV Group Plc. The figures are before exceptional items. The company incurred exceptional charges of 2.1 million stg from the introduction fo digital technology.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
